{"id":"60a10f7c9ce5cbb7","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-bounded-zero-rank.md","title":"有界个零的可计算闭类及精确点秩","display":"ex-bounded-zero-rank — 有界个零的可计算闭类及精确点秩","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-bounded-zero-rank","aliases":["20-ex-bounded-zero-rank"],"display":"ex-bounded-zero-rank — 有界个零的可计算闭类及精确点秩","chapter":"8","section":"8.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercises 8.7.1, 8.7.9","source_printed_pages":[171,173],"source_pdf_pages":[204,206],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-bounded-zero-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-bounded-zero-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-bounded-zero-rank — 有界个零的可计算闭类及精确点秩"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercises 8.7.1, 8.7.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>171</span><span>173</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>204</span><span>206</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\{i&lt;|\\sigma|:\\sigma(i)=0\\}|\\le k\\}\">\\(T_k=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\{i&lt;|\\sigma|:\\sigma(i)=0\\}|\\le k\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_k=[T_k]\">\\(C_k=[T_k]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}bounded-zero-rank}\\vdash\nD(C_0)=\\varnothing,\\qquad D(C_{k+1})=C_k,\\qquad\n\\rho_{C_k}(X)=k-|\\{i\\in\\omega:X(i)=0\\}|\\quad(X\\in C_k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}bounded-zero-rank}\\vdash\nD(C_0)=\\varnothing,\\qquad D(C_{k+1})=C_k,\\qquad\n\\rho_{C_k}(X)=k-|\\{i\\in\\omega:X(i)=0\\}|\\quad(X\\in C_k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已有恰好 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个零的点，取超过最后一个零的位置的柱，则再出现零被禁止，该点孤立。零少于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的点，可在任意晚位置再添一个零，得到任意近的不同点。反复求导逐次降低允许的零数，故给精确秩。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时是全 1 单点，秩为 0。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\">\\(T_k\\)</span> 的成员关系有限可判定；原书“至少 n 个零”的开类补集对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=n-1\">\\(k=n-1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercises 8.7.1, 8.7.9；印刷页 171, 173；PDF 第 204, 206 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","status":"resolved","id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","status":"resolved","id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"T_k=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:|\\{i<|\\sigma|:\\sigma(i)=0\\}|\\le k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C_k=[T_k]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}bounded-zero-rank}\\vdash\nD(C_0)=\\varnothing,\\qquad D(C_{k+1})=C_k,\\qquad\n\\rho_{C_k}(X)=k-|\\{i\\in\\omega:X(i)=0\\}|\\quad(X\\in C_k).","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"T_k","display":false},{"tex":"k=n-1","display":false}],"bytes":1478,"backlinks":[{"id":"aae185fc93a18a8a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega$；$C_n=[T_n]$，其中 $T_n$ 采用 [[20-ex-bounded-zero-rank]] 的定义。\n$1^n:=\\operatorname{rep}(1,n)$，$1^\\omega:=\\operatorname{rep}(1,\\omega)$；$1^n0:=1^n{}^\\frown(0)$。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-ex-bounded-zero-rank]] — 章 8；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-ex-bounded-zero-rank]]"}],"outgoing":["93a810534b87b0f9","14fc2af0ac27dcbb"]}